@bruvzg The issue is replicable on the Android simulator, however you need to use the Desktop AVD instead of the regular Phone / Tablet because those ones don't dispatch hover events.

You can check out [these instructions](https://chromeos.dev/en/posts/desktop-avd-in-android-studio#try-out-the-desktop-avd) for how to setup the Desktop AVD.

[repro_accesskit_crash_desktop_avd.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/25cea8c0-ce0f-4f07-b3bb-176d6688c4cb)
